WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.086 --> 00:00:09.601
Daisy and Kaleem paced up and down the sidewalk.

2
00:00:09.602 --> 00:00:13.233
"Who would steal pet toys?" Daisy said.

3
00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:15.994
Kaleem pointed to a house nearby.

4
00:00:15.995 --> 00:00:19.660
"That's Parker's house. Maybe he did it."

5
00:00:19.661 --> 00:00:22.477
"Parker is a bully," Daisy said.

6
00:00:22.478 --> 00:00:26.131
"But why would he steal stuff from animals?"

7
00:00:26.132 --> 00:00:30.571
Kaleem shrugged. "I saw him throw an apple at a cat once.

8
00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:33.316
Luckily the cat jumped out of the way."

9
00:00:33.317 --> 00:00:38.003
"Parker is mean enough to bully animals," Daisy said.

10
00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:42.585
"And he does live near where the crimes took place. But—"

11
00:00:42.586 --> 00:00:45.501
"Let's stake out his house," Kaleem said.

12
00:00:45.502 --> 00:00:48.339
"When he comes outside, we'll follow him.

13
00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.275
Maybe we can catch him stealing something else."

14
00:00:51.276 --> 00:00:55.572
Daisy shrugged. "We don't have any other suspects.

15
00:00:55.573 --> 00:01:00.713
Sure, let's try it."

16
00:01:00.714 --> 00:01:08.180
They found a hiding spot behind some bushes in Parker's front yard.

17
00:01:08.181 --> 00:01:12.951
Daisy and Kaleem sat on the grass.

18
00:01:12.952 --> 00:01:18.796
Beatrice buzzed away to visit some clover flowers nearby.

19
00:01:18.797 --> 00:01:22.479
Half an hour passed.

20
00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:28.333
"Being detectives is kind of boring." Kaleem yawned.

21
00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:30.862
"Even the bee looks bored."

22
00:01:30.863 --> 00:01:34.024
"What if Parker isn't home?" Daisy said.

23
00:01:34.025 --> 00:01:39.569
"Beatrice, would you go peek through the windows? Please?"

24
00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:47.856
Beatrice buzzed off.

25
00:01:47.857 --> 00:01:55.231
A few minutes later, she returned. "I didn't see anyone inside."

26
00:01:55.232 --> 00:01:56.723
Kaleem stood up.

27
00:01:56.724 --> 00:01:59.996
"Maybe Parker is out stealing more stuff right now!

28
00:01:59.997 --> 00:02:03.161
Let's go look for him."

29
00:02:03.162 --> 00:02:07.385
Just then a car turned into the driveway.

30
00:02:07.386 --> 00:02:10.411
Parker got out.

31
00:02:10.412 --> 00:02:14.823
"What are you nerds doing here?" Parker asked Daisy and Kaleem.

32
00:02:14.824 --> 00:02:20.112
"Are you looking for more birds to talk to, birdbrain Daisy?"

33
00:02:20.113 --> 00:02:25.145
Daisy frowned. "As a matter of fact, we're looking for you. A

34
00:02:25.146 --> 00:02:27.742
bunch of dog toys are missing." "And

35
00:02:27.743 --> 00:02:30.921
cat toys," Kaleem said. "Did

36
00:02:30.922 --> 00:02:33.915
you have anything to do with it, Parker?" Parker

37
00:02:33.916 --> 00:02:38.410
looked confused. "What are you talking about?" "Did

38
00:02:38.411 --> 00:02:42.549
you steal any pet toys?" Kaleem asked. "Of

39
00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:46.735
course not!" Now Parker looked angry. "Why

40
00:02:46.736 --> 00:02:50.660
would I want pet toys? I don't even have a pet." "What's

41
00:02:50.661 --> 00:02:54.059
going on here?" A

42
00:02:54.060 --> 00:03:00.092
teenage girl got out of the car. "Are

43
00:03:00.093 --> 00:03:02.764
you Parker's friends?" "No!"

44
00:03:02.765 --> 00:03:07.147
Daisy, Kaleem, and Parker all said at once. The

45
00:03:07.148 --> 00:03:10.196
teenager checked the time on her phone. "Whatever.

46
00:03:10.197 --> 00:03:13.363
Hurry up and get your homework, Parker. I

47
00:03:13.364 --> 00:03:15.767
want to get home." Parker

48
00:03:15.768 --> 00:03:23.446
glowered at Daisy and Kaleem and ran into the house. "I'm

49
00:03:23.447 --> 00:03:27.088
Parker's cousin, Nadine," the teenager said. "Who

50
00:03:27.089 --> 00:03:28.639
are you?" Daisy

51
00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:33.090
and Kaleem introduced themselves. "Do

52
00:03:33.091 --> 00:03:37.432
you know what Parker was doing earlier today?" Daisy asked. "Yes."

53
00:03:37.433 --> 00:03:42.839
Nadine nodded. "He was at my house watching TV. He

54
00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:47.241
came to stay with us yesterday afternoon because his parents went out of town. But

55
00:03:47.242 --> 00:03:51.790
he forgot his homework." She rolled her eyes. "My

56
00:03:51.791 --> 00:03:55.749
mom and dad made me drive him all the way back here to get it." "Oh,"

57
00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:58.293
Daisy said. "It

58
00:03:58.294 --> 00:04:01.437
was nice to meet you. But we have to go." Daisy

59
00:04:01.438 --> 00:04:05.397
hurried off, dragging Kaleem with her. "What

60
00:04:05.398 --> 00:04:09.239
are you doing?" Kaleem asked. "Shouldn't

61
00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.622
we question Parker some more?" "No.

62
00:04:11.623 --> 00:04:17.267
That cat said his toy disappeared today ," Daisy said.

63
00:04:17.268 --> 00:04:19.879
"Parker has been away since yesterday.

64
00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:23.012
That means he can't be the thief.

65
00:04:23.013 --> 00:04:28.875
We need a new suspect!"

